  "title": "Tag Exchange",
  "rules": [
    "Two controlled pairs oppose each other. Move on public floor; co-location, crossing and swaps are allowed. Walls leave middle and outer routes.",
    "Tag at distance at most one after movement: nearest free enemy, then lower index. Each successful attacker spends one energy; simultaneous mutual tags both land.",
    "A new tag freezes for three ticks and drops carried flag. Frozen players can wait or spend two energy to thaw. Natural timer expiry is free.",
    "An untagged free teammate may spend one energy to rescue an adjacent frozen player. Fresh same-tick tags cannot be rescued; release changes the next action boundary.",
    "At an exact flag cell, interact to return your own displaced flag or pick up the enemy flag. Contested pickup resolves by lower actor index.",
    "Pass a carried flag to your adjacent free teammate. Scoring requires enemy flag at your own exact base and your own flag home; scored enemy flag returns home.",
    "Recharge near your own base draws from its finite four-unit depot. No energy or depot stock regenerates automatically.",
    "Two captures terminate the episode. Each capture rewards both scoring teammates +1 and both opponents -1."
  ],
